<section
  class="relative w-full min-h-[85vh] flex items-center overflow-hidden bg-[#090d16] bg-grid-pattern bg-radial-gradient border-b border-slate-800/80 py-16 lg:py-24"
>
  {/* Ambient Background Glows */}
  <div class="absolute -top-40 right-0 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-10 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div
    class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"
  >
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-center">
      {/* Left Column: Startup Value Pitch */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-left">
        {/* Top Tagline */}
        <span
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 text-[11px] font-mono font-bold tracking-wide text-cyan-400 select-none shadow-inner"
        >
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          AI-NATIVE PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT FRAMEWORK
        </span>

        {/* Main Headline */}
        <h1
          class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.12]"
        >
          AI가 바뀌어도<br />
          <span class="text-gradient-cyan">
            프로젝트는 계속됩니다.
          </span>
        </h1>

        {/* Core Startup Value Pitch */}
        <p
          class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal max-w-2xl"
        >
          REPL Works는 프롬프트에 의존하던 개발 방식에서 벗어나, 프로젝트의 <strong class="text-cyan-300 font-semibold">의도·제품 정의·기술 설계·작업 계획</strong>을 Git 표준 문서로 체계화하는 문서 주도 AI 개발 프레임워크입니다.
        </p>

        {/* Problem vs Solution Comparison Card */}
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2">
          <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-4 border-slate-800/90 bg-slate-950/60">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-red-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Traditional AI Dev</span>
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-200">채팅 세션 종료시 맥락 유실</h3>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-snug">채팅이 길어질수록 환각 발생, 프롬프트 파편화 및 이전 설계 기억 손실</p>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-4 border-cyan-500/30 bg-cyan-950/20">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">REPL Works Method</span>
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Git 기반 문서 보존 & 연속성</h3>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300 mt-1 leading-snug">모든 개발 규칙과 세부 작업을 Markdown 문서로 보존하여 다음 세션도 즉시 시작</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Action CTA Buttons */}
        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="/workflow"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-950 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-emerald-400 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/20 hover:shadow-cyan-500/30 hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all group shrink-0"
          >
            <span>워크플로 실행 가이드</span>
            <svg
              class="h-4 w-4 ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"
              fill="none"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke-width="3"
              stroke="currentColor"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="/documents"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-200 bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white hover:border-slate-700 transition-all shrink-0"
          >
            표준 문서 구조 보기
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Right Column: 6-Step Pipeline Interactive Glass Card */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 w-full">
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/90 bg-[#0c1322]/90 p-5 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
          {/* Top Window Bar */}
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800/80 pb-3 mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/80 inline-block"></span>
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/80 inline-block"></span>
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-green-500/80 inline-block"></span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-400">replworks-pipeline.config</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-800/60">LIVE PIPELINE</span>
          </div>

          {/* Pipeline Cards Grid */}
          <p class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 mb-3 tracking-wide uppercase">AUTHORITATIVE DOCUMENT FLOW</p>
          <div class="space-y-2.5">
            {[
              { step: '01', file: 'IDEAS.md', tag: 'Human Input', desc: '아이디어 및 비즈니스 동기', color: 'border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-300' },
              { step: '02', file: 'PITCHING_SCRIPT.md', tag: 'Human Input', desc: '제품 핵심 포지셔닝', color: 'border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-300' },
              { step: '03', file: 'PRODUCT_SPEC.md', tag: 'Discussion AI', desc: '제품 정의 및 스펙 요구사항', color: 'border-cyan-500/40 bg-cyan-950/30 text-cyan-200' },
              { step: '04', file: 'TECH_STACK.md', tag: 'Discussion AI', desc: '기술 스택 & 구현 규칙', color: 'border-cyan-500/40 bg-cyan-950/30 text-cyan-200' },
              { step: '05', file: 'ARCHITECTURE.md', tag: 'Discussion AI', desc: '시스템 설계 및 컴포넌트 구조', color: 'border-cyan-500/40 bg-cyan-950/30 text-cyan-200' },
              { step: '06', file: 'TASKS.md', tag: 'Execution AI', desc: '실행 계획 & 개별 TASK 마일스톤', color: 'border-emerald-500/50 bg-emerald-950/40 text-emerald-200' },
            ].map((item) => (
              <div class={`flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-xl border ${item.color} transition-all hover:scale-[1.01]`}>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 min-w-0">
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-extrabold text-slate-500">{item.step}</span>
                  <span class="font-mono font-black text-xs tracking-tight">{item.file}</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[9px] font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-950/80 text-slate-400 border border-slate-800">
                  {item.tag}
                </span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          {/* Bottom Execution Status Footer */}
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
              Execution Rule: One Task = One Commit
            </span>
            <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">100% Reliable</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
